    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classTestabilityGrader" kindref="compound">TestabilityGrader</ref> goes through the R/W set json files generated by <ref refid="classLocalRWSetGenerator" kindref="compound">LocalRWSetGenerator</ref> and recursively goes through each function&apos;s calledFunctions to rate the full testability of the function. It does NOT use ROSE. </para>    </briefdescription>
